    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Darkness rollercaster is an Arcade / Shooter where the player has to face enemies in a variety of environments.<br />\r\nDive into Cave, Space, Fantasy land and more to live this amazing railshooter adventure ! <br />\r\nShoot enemies with your game controller (3D Rudder Compatible), block their attacks with your shield or slow down time.<br />\r\nBut beware of the pitfalls and obstacles you will need to avoid when moving your vehicle at any time!<br />\r\nActivate your special vision to recover all the secrets and defeat the final boss ...<br />\r\nCompare your score with your friends and win the best shooter trophies!<br />\r\nDo you want to live a fantastic experience that will hook you to your seat?<br />\r\nDo you like action, emotions and sensations?<br />\r\n+ This version also include the Soundtrack pack for Anniversary edition.<br />\r\nMore than 20 musics await you in a level specially designed to listen to them or the decorations light up to the rhythm of the musics.<br />\r\nTry Rollercoaster Darkness - The Ultimate Shooter Edition!",
    "about_the_game": "Darkness rollercaster is an Arcade / Shooter where the player has to face enemies in a variety of environments.<br />\r\nDive into Cave, Space, Fantasy land and more to live this amazing railshooter adventure ! <br />\r\nShoot enemies with your game controller (3D Rudder Compatible), block their attacks with your shield or slow down time.<br />\r\nBut beware of the pitfalls and obstacles you will need to avoid when moving your vehicle at any time!<br />\r\nActivate your special vision to recover all the secrets and defeat the final boss ...<br />\r\nCompare your score with your friends and win the best shooter trophies!<br />\r\nDo you want to live a fantastic experience that will hook you to your seat?<br />\r\nDo you like action, emotions and sensations?<br />\r\n+ This version also include the Soundtrack pack for Anniversary edition.<br />\r\nMore than 20 musics await you in a level specially designed to listen to them or the decorations light up to the rhythm of the musics.<br />\r\nTry Rollercoaster Darkness - The Ultimate Shooter Edition!",
    "short_description": "The ultimate rail shooter in this corner of the Galaxy !",
